# 3. Verify

Run, in one invocation, the unit and integration suites of every project the
run touched plus every node id traced in the reviewed outcomes (the `tests`
of every `{{ outcome_filename }}` under `{{ inputs_dirname }}/`):

    {{ junit_command_prefix }} -m "not acceptance and not release" <project directories> <traced node ids>

A traced test carrying the `release` or `acceptance` marker is deselected by
that filter: run without `-m` instead, so that every traced node id is in the
report.

